                "line": 198,
                "quote": "| Ok [ \"backup\"; path ] -> UseCases.backup ports path |> render showBackup"
              }
            ],
            "rationale": "The change adds no new lending rule. The amount owed per member is still decided by the existing Accounts.owed. Views.totalOwed only adds those amounts up for a projection, and Views.summary only counts collections. Both are Tier 3 projection work. The refusal to overwrite an existing file is a file-handling policy, not a lending rule, and it sits in a Tier 3 use case. The CLI only sends commands on to use cases and renders the views they return.",
            "score": 2
          },
          "ARC-REV-02": {
            "evidence": [
